  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "core-loop",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 930,
      "w": 420,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "CORE LOOP\nSplash → Play → Game sheet → run → Result. Endless runs: the first mistake ends a run; one rewarded-ad revive per run; run time recorded. Memory Lane and Quick Math pick Easy / Medium / Hard on the sheet; Rocket Launch and Guess Color ramp up during the run. The in-game bar shows only the game, difficulty (or skill) and score."
    },
    {
      "id": "rocket-run",
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 1914,
      "w": 390,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "ROCKET LAUNCH\nOne hit ends the run (or shows the revive offer). Score only, no timer."
    },
    {
      "id": "guess-phases",
      "x": 3290,
      "y": 1914,
      "w": 390,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "GUESS COLOR PHASES (by word number)\n1–8 four colors · 9–18 six colors · 19–30 shuffled · 31–45 mismatched names · 46+ tinted buttons.\n\nShown: a mismatched-names word — each name is drawn in another color, with no swatch."
    },
    {
      "id": "tabs",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2044,
      "w": 400,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "TABS & SETTINGS\nRanks · Play · Profile in the bottom nav, with Play in the middle; Settings from the gear on Play.\n\nLeaderboard names and scores are sample data."
    },
    {
      "id": "ranks-boards",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 2928,
      "w": 390,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "RANKS\nOne Global Top 10 at a time: pick a game, then a difficulty. The Easy / Medium / Hard row only appears for Memory Lane and Quick Math; Rocket Launch and Guess Color have a single board. There is no \"All\" view. Each row shows the run time; ties rank the faster run higher. Opens on the game you last played (after posting, on that game's board)."
    },
    {
      "id": "identity-brief",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -170,
      "w": 560,
      "page": "page-2",
      "text": "IDENTITY OPTIONS\nChosen: LogicSprint with the double chevron (Option A). It is the name and mark used on every screen and in the app.\n\nOptions B–D are kept here for reference only."
    }
  ],
